<title>USA: AMEX closing averages.</title>
<headline>AMEX closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the American Stock Exchange closed higher in active trading.</p>
<p>The Amex index closed at 590.48, up 4.78.</p>
<p>Winners beat losers 347 to 235.</p>
<p>The average price per share rose $0.11.</p>
<p>Preliminary volume was 20,186,915, compared with 25,598,640 on Friday.</p>
<p>	  (Prices official as of 1330 EST/1830 GMT)</p>
</text>
